(text "BRK-4 CARD, card type 0x0013. 4 breaker coil outputs: OUT1 GCB close, OUT2 GCB\nopen, OUT3 MCB close, OUT4 MCB open.\nSelf-contained: own SN74LVC541A enable buffer (OUT_EN_N gated), own TMUX1208\ncurrent-sense mux to ANA_OUT, own MCP23S17 behind IOFF slot buffers. Shared\nclamps D128/D130 split: their GLOW/AUX1 halves are left NC here.\nPass 1: REQ/DIAG_EN/MUX_A 47k pull-downs (boot-safe), OUT_EN_N pull-up on\n+3V3_ID, 100 nF/100 V at every VS + 2.2 uF bulk, ILIM 33.2k: 2.41/3.01/3.61 A.\nPass 2 MAJ-6: every GCB/MCB trip/close/motor-operator coil is switched through\nan external interposing relay (relay coil <= 2.4 A incl. pull-in); never drive\na breaker coil directly. R_SNS 910 + 4.7k into the clamp. Slot MISO 33R,\nINTA_B pull-up.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-3 OUT1-4_REQ, GPA4 DIAG_EN, GPA5-7 SLOT_ID0-2; GPB0-3\nOUT1-4_RB_N, GPB4-6 MUX_A0-2, GPB7 SLOT_IDP.\nBaseline names: OUT1 GCB_CL, OUT2 GCB_OP, OUT3 MCB_CL, OUT4 MCB_OP. Net\nchanges: net_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 80.01 171.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a06af7b7-1572-4c2a-b24d-656d1fa3c9bf"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
